import sys,hashlib,pathlib
p=pathlib.Path(sys.argv[1])
assert not p.exists()
b=("diff --git a/src/resources/extensions/gsd/prompts/complete-milestone.md b/src/resources/extensions/gsd/prompts/complete-milestone.md\n--- a/src/resources/extensions/gsd/prompts/complete-milestone.md\n+++ b/src/resources/extensions/gsd/prompts/complete-milestone.md\n@@ -39,6 +39,35 @@\n \n 9. **Persist completion through `gsd_complete_milestone`.** Call it with the parameters below. The tool updates the milestone status in the DB, renders `{{milestoneSummaryPath}}`, and validates all slices are complete before proceeding.\n \n+   **Tool-call formatting is JSON, NOT YAML or Markdown.** The inlined Milestone Summary\n+   template is for the generated `.md` file only. Its `- {{decision}}` and other\n+   YAML list items must NEVER be copied into tool arguments. Pass `keyDecisions`,\n+   `keyFiles`, and `lessonsLearned` as JSON arrays of strings (use `[]` when empty),\n+   not bullet lists or single strings. `followUps` and `deviations` are optional\n+   **strings**, not arrays. For example, a valid tool argument object is:\n+\n+   ```json\n+   {\n+     \"milestoneId\": \"M001\",\n+     \"title\": \"Example milestone\",\n+     \"oneLiner\": \"Delivered the planned milestone outcome.\",\n+     \"narrative\": \"Implementation and integration summary.\",\n+     \"successCriteriaResults\": \"- Criterion: verified with tests.\",\n+     \"definitionOfDoneResults\": \"- All slices complete.\",\n+     \"requirementOutcomes\": \"- Requirement: validated with evidence.\",\n+     \"keyDecisions\": [\"Use the existing notification API\"],\n+     \"keyFiles\": [\"src/example.ts — implemented notification handling\"],\n+     \"lessonsLearned\": [\"Verify integration before completion\"],\n+     \"verificationPassed\": true,\n+     \"followUps\": \"Review additional edge cases.\"\n+   }\n+   ```\n+\n+   Replace example values with the actual verified milestone results. Do not\n+   send this example unchanged. Ensure the entire tool call is valid JSON:\n+   property names and strings in double quotes, array elements separated by\n+   commas, and no unquoted `- item` values.\n+\n    **Required parameters:**\n    - `milestoneId` (string) — Milestone ID (e.g. M001)\n    - `title` (string) — Milestone title\ndiff --git a/src/resources/extensions/gsd/templates/milestone-summary.md b/src/resources/extensions/gsd/templates/milestone-summary.md\n--- a/src/resources/extensions/gsd/templates/milestone-summary.md\n+++ b/src/resources/extensions/gsd/templates/milestone-summary.md\n@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@\n+<!-- This template describes the rendered Markdown/YAML milestone summary file.\n+     The YAML dash-prefixed lists below are NOT gsd_complete_milestone tool arguments.\n+     When calling that tool, use JSON arrays of strings for keyDecisions,\n+     keyFiles, and lessonsLearned (e.g. [\"decision 1\", \"decision 2\"]). -->\n ---\n id: {{milestoneId}}\n provides:\n").encode('utf-8')
assert len(b)==2783
assert hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest()=='517bccfc788318cf69848d6ed4396ddd7beb325dd542b023ec56ba50ca4c716b'
p.write_bytes(b)
